# L §5.14.1, §5.16 Decisions and projections (LOAD-RANDOM where load sees the projection reach a random fact after
# its t; tally 2.1.6, issue #75): sweep's own projection from start_of(m) reaches gift, a random move with no at,
# whose amount is dated by its day, 2026-03-01, after t. tally 2.1.5's refcore saw only a random move with an at,
# so q answered. T's held basic/random-projection; the engine's bytes.
=== base.tally
model basic
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's base for M0's load-code fixtures (invented): it loads clean; each fixture of codes/m0/edits.tsv changes one line"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index qs = [q1, q2]

index gm = month 2026-02..2026-02

input amt: money PLN

input day: date

input ru: dist PLN

input rate[k in qs]: num

def fee[k in qs]: money PLN
  rule base v card_2026 = round(amt * rate[k], minor(PLN), half-up)
  rule waived beats base v card_2026 = 0 PLN when rate[k] == 0

def total: money PLN = sum(fee[k] for k in qs)

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move gift[m in gm]: transfers
  on end_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount round(ru, minor(PLN), half-up)

move sweep[m in gm]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to world amount bal(konto, end_of(m)) from start_of(m)

move pay: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee[q1]

ask q: total

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
  day = 2026-02-10 "the card"
  ru = uniform(0 PLN, 4 PLN) to 0.01 PLN "the card"
  rate[q1] = 0.1 "the card"
  rate[q2] = 0 "the card"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
=== expect q
refused: LOAD-RANDOM sweep[2026-02] on 2026-02-01: bal(konto, end_of(m)) from start_of(m) reaches random ru after 2026-02-01 with no random clause or query (base.tally:41)
